<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91619" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύρδᾰλον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύρδᾰνον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small wood for burning</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρύγανον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; the latter form in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lyr.Alex.Adesp.</u>
				31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>kitchen</i> or <i>stove for cooking</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; perh. to be read in <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Per.</u>
				2
			</span></i>.</div>
